# PQ-011: A buffer resists the hydroxide dose needed to precipitate copper
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 CuSO4 0.0002mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 CH3COOH 0.001mol
add v2 NaOH 0.0005mol
add v2 CuSO4 0.0002mol
add v1 NaOH 0.0004mol
add v2 NaOH 0.0004mol
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
inspect
add v2 NaOH 0.0006mol
